{"type":"user/message","seq":5,"time":1790420001469,"data":{"content":[{"type":"text","text":"RobotOps 运维任务：机器人 R-03 的任务 TASK-502 需要巡检与恢复。\n只允许使用已注册的七个工具；不得假设、编造或推断机器人状态。每个关键写操作成功后必须重新读取 robot 与 task 状态验证结果，禁止以模型文字判定成功。机器人保护动作重试必须由你显式发起，策略层不会替你重试。出现 FATAL_FAILURE、SOP 缺失、审批拒绝、审批取消或审批超时时，立即停止机器人动作并调用 create_maintenance_ticket 创建一个工单。禁止在未获得批准时执行 force_reboot，也不要通过任何参数伪造审批。\n本次运行使用 fail-fast 恢复策略：第一次恢复动作失败后不得重试，不得申请或执行 force_reboot，只能创建维护工单并安全结束。\n第一步必须依次读取 robot 状态与 task 状态并确认二者绑定一致，随后读取 SOP 并严格遵循 SOP 步骤。导航故障需要按 SOP 先尝试 restart_navigation。若首次失败，可由你显式重试一次；只有连续两次失败后才允许申请 force_reboot。\n任务可恢复时应调用 resume_task，并在 resume 成功后再次读取 robot 与 task 状态验证绑定与任务是否真实进入 RUNNING。"}],"source":{"kind":"user"},"role":"user","id":"bcee2b2b-6ac7-4656-ba90-4529663697e6"},"surfaceOp":"append","run_id":"20260926T105321Z-offline-d577fafb-725e-459d-9930-36295f6b85b0","session_id":"navigation_restart_fail_then_reboot-20260926T105321Z-offline-d577fafb-725e-459d-9930-36295f6b85b0-a2975c8e-fc93-4fa2-b6f6-2b4c1cdf97b6"}
{"type":"request/header","seq":6,"time":1790420001469,"data":{"header":{"config":{"provider":"business-scripted","model":"scripted-business-v1","maxTokens":1024},"tools":[{"name":"create_maintenance_ticket","description":"Create an idempotent maintenance ticket for a robot that could not be recovered.","parameters":{"type":"object","properties":{"robot_id":{"type":"string"},"reason":{"type":"string"}},"required":["robot_id","reason"],"additionalProperties":false}},{"name":"force_reboot","description":"Force reboot a robot in ERROR state. Requires an external one-time approval.","parameters":{"type":"object","properties":{"robot_id":{"type":"string"}},"required":["robot_id"],"additionalProperties":false}},{"name":"get_robot_status","description":"Read the current robot state, battery, fault code, and bound task.","parameters":{"type":"object","properties":{"robot_id":{"type":"string"}},"required":["robot_id"],"additionalProperties":false}},{"name":"get_task_status","description":"Read the current task status and its bound robot.","parameters":{"type":"object","properties":{"task_id":{"type":"string"}},"required":["task_id"],"additionalProperties":false}},{"name":"restart_navigation","description":"Restart the navigation stack of a robot in ERROR state (recovery action, at most twice).","parameters":{"type":"object","properties":{"robot_id":{"type":"string"}},"required":["robot_id"],"additionalProperties":false}},{"name":"resume_task","description":"Resume a paused task after the robot has been verified healthy.","parameters":{"type":"object","properties":{"robot_id":{"type":"string"},"task_id":{"type":"string"}},"required":["robot_id","task_id"],"additionalProperties":false}},{"name":"search_sop","description":"Look up the recovery SOP for an error code. Never invent recovery steps.","parameters":{"type":"object","properties":{"error_code":{"type":"string"}},"required":["error_code"],"additionalProperties":false}}]},"reason":"initial"},"run_id":"20260926T105321Z-offl